<title>PORTUGAL: NO PORTUGAL EDP INVESTOR ABOVE ONE PCT.</title>
<headline>NO PORTUGAL EDP INVESTOR ABOVE ONE PCT.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>EDP-Electricidade de Portugal, the state-controlled utility, said that no single investor bought more than one percent of its stock at the partial privatisation.</p>
<p>The government floated 30 percent of EDP in the sale on June 16.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
